WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:14.490
<b>Land of Iga, Near the Iga Village</b>

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.240
Come out!

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:22.280
I know you're there.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:27.090
The whole world comes down 
to the roll of the dice.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.260
They roll and roll on the mat.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:33.760
A woman?

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:38.530
You dream and dream. And at the end,

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:43.040
you will eventually die.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.270
Well, that was quite the poem.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.210
Oh, my.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.400
You're giving me money?

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:56.910
It will pay your fare across the Sanzu River.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:59.690
What a strange thing to say.

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:01.910
Why would I cross the Sanzu River?

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:04.350
You can't fool me.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:07.210
If anyone breaks my root barrier,

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:10.630
the impregnable defense of 
the Five Flowers of Iga,

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:13.420
they won't escape, no matter who they are.

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:17.160
These roots are a barrier?

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:20.050
Then, you are Tsuta Houetsu-sama?

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:24.750
So you're some fox, from
somewhere? What's your name?

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:27.560
I shall tell you, as a gift 
before your death.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:30.310
I am Yasha Itaru.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:32.350
Don't make me laugh!

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:35.240
You're the one who'll be receiving a gift.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:38.070
No, you're as good as dead...

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:41.530
Taste my ninja technique! <i>Root Lasso</i>!

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:27.190
You can't move. How sad...

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:30.230
Now, what to do with you?

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.540
But...

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:38.500
Killing you quickly...

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:41.860
would be a shame.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.430
How disgusting.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:01.010
Aren't you ashamed for a member of the Five 
Flowers of Iga to behave in such a way?

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:03.880
Aren't you ashamed to look in the mirror?

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.240
Mirror?

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:29.490
Oh?

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:34.340
You saw your pathetic life, didn't you?

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:38.170
A meaningless life, with no joy,

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.550
and without pride.

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:44.180
I understand...

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.430
Despair that makes you wish for death.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:49.050
In that case...

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:00.100
Fall from that cliff, and die!

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:11.410
Once you look into this mirror and 
know the futility of your life,

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:15.260
you cannot escape my Destiny's Passage.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:21.210
<b><i>The Joujinshuu Appear</i></b>

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.470
Suruga-sama, have you forgotten me?

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:34.600
It was years ago, of course,

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:42.110
when your brother, Lord Iemitsu, 
was afflicted with the pox.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:48.140
When the great priest Tenkai 
prayed for his health,

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:51.490
I accompanied him.

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:55.500
Yes. I was there, as well...

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:05.380
But why would that priest do 
something to mock me?

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.730
Me?

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:13.140
No, were those words not your own?

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:14.390
What?

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:21.150
What did you say?

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:28.040
"Someday, my brother will slay me,"

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:28.890
I said.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.610
S-Silence!

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.330
Nonsense...

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.660
I... I would never say that!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.150
Magoroku.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:37.660
Yes, sir.

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:44.670
I am Kujaku Tsuibamu...

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:47.550
I am Rinne Magoroku.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:51.870
We've no choice. Do it to him.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.120
Are you quite certain?

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:59.300
It's fine. Make him remember.

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.740
As you wish.

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:52.940
What is this place?

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:58.120
What Rinne Magoroku has manifested 
here is Akyashagaruba,

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:02.090
the Kokuuzou Bosatsu.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:06.540
The original meaning of the word 
"akyasha" was "void,"

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.430
and "garuba" meant "womb."

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:11.860
In other words, the source from 
which things are born.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:16.960
Put another way, Kokuuzou Bosatsu

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:20.220
is as infinite as the void.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:23.640
His own universe. His own spacetime.

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.650
Universe?

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:30.150
The skill of Rinne Magoroku,

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:33.480
is to manifest this Kokuuzou Bosatsu.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:36.580
It is called the Adamantite Tower.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:41.160
<b>The Adamantite Tower</b>

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:57.260
A man?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.180
Yes.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:03.030
How much do you know?

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:04.370
About men...

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:05.880
How much?

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:09.190
I know they're brutes, and bratty, and stink.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.520
No, I'm not talking about that.

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.940
How much do you know about men's bodies?

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:15.860
What are you saying?

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.890
It's about our skills.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:20.450
Your skill and mine are similar.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.870
I know...

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:22.950
You can summon bugs.

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:27.810
You've heard that this power 
goes beyond that, right?

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:31.960
My skill is to seduce women to my will.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.250
And your skill is...

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:39.360
You don't know anything about women, either.

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:40.720
No...

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.180
I'm not interested in girls.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:49.570
Houetsu!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.160
Houetsu!

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.240
Shuugetsu... Izuma.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:56.110
Have you found him?

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.990
Then, that voice was...

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.100
No, that's impossible.

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.840
A man like Houetsu could not be defeated.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:04.500
Find him!

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:12.500
Is this the man you're searching for?

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.390
Am I wrong?

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:18.400
Or can't you tell?

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:19.650
I can understand why.

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:22.520
Everyone's face looks this way

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:26.140
after they've been struck by 
Yasha Itaru's Destiny's Passage.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:27.080
Houetsu!

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.900
Who are you? Give me your name.

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:32.900
My name?

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:37.650
It's a little hard to remember... Neirichiou.

00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:39.850
Neirichiou?

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:41.220
I'll try to remember that.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.910
No, I will have to.

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:48.040
I'll need to write it on your grave.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.250
Oh, how nice!

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.560
You'll dig my grave,

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:55.340
and mark it with my name?

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:59.380
Then, you must defeat this, as well...

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:25.810
Are you all right, Suruga Dainagon-sama?

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.750
I feel so dizzy...

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.960
Just wait a moment.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.500
You will get used to it.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.920
Used to what?

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.630
The flow of time.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:42.880
You are walking, not through space,

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:45.060
but through the flow of time.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:49.390
You are walking backward, into the past.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:51.620
The past?

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:53.150
What are you saying?

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:58.170
Someday, your brother will slay you.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:06.960
We are revisiting the moment 
at which you thought this.

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:10.360
My skill, the Inverted Halberd of Time,

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:13.920
makes the gears of time run backward.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:17.110
If I scattered all these sands of time,

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:19.800
there's no way to know how far we'd go.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:22.870
Don't worry.

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:25.520
As long as they are sealed in there,

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:28.550
he can only travel back a short time.

00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:32.200
Right now, we are borrowing the power

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:35.560
of this space to go a little further back.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.190
Impossible...

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:44.450
Now, it appears we have come 
back to the correct time.

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:50.030
Brother...

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.390
This is when he was younger.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.960
Are you showing me illusions?

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:58.160
It is no illusion.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.280
You remember it.

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:06.450
You are seeing the time and place 
when a young Iemitsu-sama

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:09.220
was afflicted with the pox.

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.300
Is that... me?

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.480
Suruga-sama.

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:22.470
This is... I remember this.

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:25.860
Strangely, no attendants or 
serving girls were around.

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:29.230
I was alone with him.

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:39.230
Brother, how are you feeling?

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:41.260
Are you in pain?

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:45.130
Brother... are you all right?

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:49.220
Just wait, Brother. I'll get a doctor—

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:14.410
A dream...

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.140
Then, it was a dream?

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:20.460
No, it was no dream.

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:22.860
Indeed.

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:27.870
It was all real. You saw 
it with your own eyes.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:30.350
Takechiyo-sama,

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:34.560
Iemitsu-sama has never forgotten it.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:40.010
When he was at death's door,

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:45.710
you were at his bedside, 
the picture of health.

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:50.280
The feelings he had toward you,

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:58.240
the envy the sick have for the 
wealth of the able-bodied...

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.590
That is impossible to change.

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:02.290
I was...

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:07.330
Back then, I was simply praying 
for my brother's recovery...

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:12.350
Your personal thoughts are irrelevant.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:16.220
The important thing is that, on your face,

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:26.970
your brother saw the joy and ambition of 
the one who would be the next shogun.

00:15:26.970 --> 00:15:28.110
You lie...

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:32.370
You just saw it for yourself, did you not?

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:43.340
E-Even if my brother did think 
that, for a moment...

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:46.070
That's all over!

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:50.200
There's no need for him to be jealous!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:55.310
Then, why did the Kurokuwa attack you?

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.320
The Kurokuwa of Iga pose no threat

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:03.150
to the people, but they work 
directly for the Shogunate.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:07.580
So why did they act against your will?

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:09.580
It makes no sense.

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:10.650
Then...

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.210
Yes.

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:16.430
You, yourself, had doubts about this.

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:20.660
And you choked back the words 
that appeared in your heart.

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:24.620
"Has my brother sent them to kill me?"

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:29.140
S-Silence! Silence!

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:33.550
Your tone of voice tells me that I am right.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:37.680
You have realized this, as well, haven't you?

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:43.870
Your brother's jealousy still remains!

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:45.940
Impossible... Impossible!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.710
Resolve yourself to rebellion!

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:49.690
What?

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.820
Rebellion.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:17:01.950
There is no other way to survive.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.960
<b>Jison'in Village</b>

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:17.470
<b>Joujinshuu</b>

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.470
Joujinshuu?

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:24.230
Is this the name of the group 
Gei'in and the others fought?

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:37.080
We're almost to the Iga village.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:38.620
What's wrong?

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:43.630
This is...

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:56.410
Rui!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.890
Yeah, over here, too...

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.560
Are these the Five Flowers of Iga?

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.650
Let us pray that they are not.

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:19.430
The forest...

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:24.330
Yes, unless the forest is moved, 
failure is impossible.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:25.300
What?

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:29.520
I heard such a story from the barbarians.

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:34.050
And in accordance with the story, 
I shall make you a promise.

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:38.930
D-Do you mock me?!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.450
A forest could not move!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:44.350
Indeed, it is impossible.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:51.310
And that is why I say that 
this rebellion cannot fail.

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:54.230
Suruga-sama...

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:58.070
Become a god!

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:08.020
They have returned, it seems.

00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:14.160
These are...

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:24.230
Shogyou Kareha, Tsuta Houetsu, 
Irootoroe Itsuma.

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:26.650
And Suiren Shuugetsu.

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:32.600
These are the heads of four of the 
famous Five Flowers of Iga.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:35.980
Did you do this?

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:39.290
I am Yasha Itaru.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.620
Two remain.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.370
Two... remain?

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:53.140
The Five Treasures of Kouga's 
leader, Kouga Hachirou.

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:56.880
And the Five Flowers of 
Iga's leader, Iga Hibiki.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:59.130
Why have you done this?

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:05.030
To demonstrate our power to you.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.260
And also...

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:14.770
Out of our desire that your mother survive.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:19.030
You would even save my mother?

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.030
I don't like pain...

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:27.490
I wonder if it hurts when you die.

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:32.120
I don't... like pain.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:34.820
I don't—

00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:36.430
Don't think about it too much.

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:37.540
But...

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.300
For Hachirou's sake...

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:44.090
You could die?

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.390
Yeah.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:47.300
Same as you, Hachisu.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:48.810
You'd die for Hibiki.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:52.350
For Hibiki? No, I wouldn't.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.810
For us.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:58.690
Because we need Hibiki and Hachirou's magic.

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:03.320
We need their blood.

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:13.140
Utsutsu... Utsutsu!

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:21.010
What are you doing?

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.180
The sky. Look at the sky!

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:28.310
The sky? What about the sky?

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:29.780
Why can't you see it?

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:31.430
Are your eye sockets empty?!

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:33.200
Shut up!

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:34.810
My eye sockets aren't the empty ones.

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:36.310
They're here.

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:42.940
My eyes... Really?

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.010
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:29.130
Neirichiou, one of the Joujinshuu.

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:33.770
His skill mocks and overwhelms 
the young children.

00:23:33.770 --> 00:23:38.970
And in the face of Joujin, will Hachirou's 
power lose its meaning?

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:38.020
<b><i>The Cherry Blossoms Run Mad</i></b>
